    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "# Connecting Hardware\r\n\r\n1. Examine the computer hardware presented here. Click parts and attach them to the motherboard where they belong.\r\n2. Once added, **Power On** the machine to see if it boots up.\r\n3. Experiment by removing parts while the machine is running or trying to load the machine without parts. What happens as a result?",
